{"song_id": 10953237, "title": "Flip Klub", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "intro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Dans le premier manifeste du C.R.O.U. il \u00e9tait question de reconstruction fragmentaire", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Nous verrons donc son implicite efficacit\u00e9 aupr\u00e8s des diff\u00e9rentes couches composant la tetra-connexion", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "(connexion)", "rhyme": null, "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Individu \u00e9vid\u00e9 de tout son sens est vid\u00e9", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Sa vie, un vide \u00e9vident", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "O\u00f9 donc est ta vie d'avant ?", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "T'as pas de copain d'avant ?", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Tu ne fais plus de lov\u00e9", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Trop mat\u00e9 Sophie Davant", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Tout \u00e7a fait pas saliver", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "C'est pas Garou \"Sous Le Vent\"", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Et si tu veux mon avis", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "On reprendra les devants", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Car le Stup \u0435st ton ami", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Le C.R.O.U. te fout la p\u00e9toche", "rhyme": "OS", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "12", "text": "Y'\u0435n a marre d'ces groupes de taches", "rhyme": "aS", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "13", "text": "Aux sons du Stup tu t'attaches", "rhyme": "aS", "persona_id": "kingju